  validation,WF-101,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/prfaq.md,Workflows and Failure Paths,105,2,"- WF-101 Measurement-only baseline: bind a named task to provider, model, repository state, and quality checks; run without intervention; capture sanitized cache counters and outcome evidence."
  security,,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/qa-strategy.md,Automation Strategy,119,2,6. `privacy-and-replay`: scan forbidden fields/content and replay the report solely from sanitized receipts. Any mismatch or leak invalidates the affected evidence.
  validation,,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/qa.md,PILOT-02 — Isolated test-only change,126,2,"- Changed-file set contains exactly one new Python test file under `tests/`; no production, configuration, spec, or existing test file changes."
  security,,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/requirements-readiness.md,"Data, Integrations, and Non-Functional Requirements",113,2,"- NFR coverage: safety, privacy, determinism, reversibility, compatibility, auditability, fail-safety, reproducibility, and performance measurement are specified."
  validation,,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/delivery-gap-review.md,"Data, Integrations, and Non-Functional Requirements",104,2,"- Data-source gap: local JSONL fields are evidence, not a stable provider contract. No schema version, fallback, receipt schema, or provenance hash is defined."
  security,,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/discovery.md,"Data, Integrations, and Non-Functional Requirements",97,2,- NFR-D002 Privacy: core measurement and control must remain local and require no centralized collection.

